/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 209 0 R
/E (In conclusion, the current study shows that although airbag technology is effective in reducing loads during touchdown, the structural design of the inner shell remains a critical factor in mission success. It is important to balance out all aspects of design to ensure the lightest possible structure while maintaining reliability. The next steps include simulation optimization of the model using computer analysis and designing the technology for more complex structures.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
